oved Maid Marian was actually  Zelena the Wicked Witch of the West and  then Hades threatened the life of his  other true love Regina forcing Robin to  sacrifice himself to save her ladies  first  Ramsay Bolton Game of Thrones murder  sadist and serial rapist Ramsay Bolton  was arguably the most evil character in  the entire run of Game of Thrones which  is saying something on the show that  gave us Joffrey Baratheon and since bad  people thrive on Game of Thrones we  expected him to outlive everyone but  after Ramsay go to Jon Snow into war  their conflict erupted into the bloody  Battle of the bastards finally  face-to-face with John Ramsay tried to  avoid a physical fight by firing arrows  at him only to be tackled beaten bloody  and tossed into a dungeon where he  suffered the final indignity of being  eaten alive by his own dogs on the order  of the wife he wants gleefully tortured  Hodor  Game of Thrones fans finally learned how  brand Starks protector Hodor got his  name Mughal poodle but it came in one of  the most heartbreaking plot twists in  the show's history turns out his name  was really Willis but in a time travel  mishap Brandon advertently showed Willis  a vision of his own death while serving  as a human barricade against a horde of  zombies the poor kid collapsed screaming  hold the door while in present-day Hodor  made the ultimate sacrifice we're really  gonna miss you big guy thanks for  watching subscribe to our YouTube  channel to watch more videos like the  one you just saw and leave us a comment  to let us know which character deaths  shocked you the most this year
 

